XIV. The Pre-Registration Commitment

The AWA-0 protocol is pre-registered before data collection begins. The pre-registration includes:

· All hypotheses
· All conditions
· All measures
· The analysis plan
· The success criteria
· The failure criteria
· The stopping rules

Pre-registration prevents post-hoc hypothesis generation and protects against p-hacking. It ensures that the results, whatever they are, can be interpreted as planned.

